<!-- start Emergency Campus Closure Text 
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert</h3>
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to unforeseen circumstances, both campuses of Shelton State Community College are closed until further notice. Please monitor social media for updates.</p>
-->

<!-- start Unforeseen Maintenance Campus Closure Text 
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert</h3>
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to an unforeseen maintenance issue at the Fredd Campus, in-person classes are canceled and the campus will be closed on <b>Wednesday, April 23, 2025</b>. This includes Pre-K. Updates will be provided as they become available. We apologize for the inconvenience.</p>
-->


<!-- start Scheduled Maintenance Campus Closure Text
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert</h3>
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to ongoing campus maintenance and construction, Shelton State Community College will be closed to the public on <b>Friday, June 26, 2026 </b>. The closure impacts the Fredd and Martin Campuses. </p>



<!-- start Utility Disruptions Closure Text 
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert: Martin Campus Closure</h3>
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to a utility disruption, Shelton State's Martin Campus is temporarily closed. All classes and activities, including tonight's Collegiate 100® Songs of Unity Concert, have been cancelled. SSCC is working to restore services. All activities and classes at the Fredd Campus are ongoing. Additional information will be provided via the College’s website, SSCC Alert!, and social media as necessary.  </p>


<!-- start Service Disruption Closure Text 
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert: Fredd Campus Closure</h3> 
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to a power outage, Shelton State Community College’s Fredd Campus is closed <b>today, Thursday, October 1, 2026</b>. This closure includes all classes and activities. The closure does <b>not</b> impact the Martin Campus. </p>


<!-- start SSCC Monitoring Weather Alert Text  
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert</h3> 
			<p style="margin-top:0px;"> Shelton State Community College is closely monitoring the potential threat of severe weather that is forecast for Thursday, September 12, 2024, for the Tuscaloosa area. All SSCC locations remain open at this time. If conditions change, the College will update the campus community. </p>
-->


<!-- start SSCC Weather Alert Text Closure 
<h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert</h3>
<p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to the threat of severe weather predicted for the West Alabama area, Shelton State Community College will be closed Friday, January 12, 2024. This closure includes both campuses.  All scheduled activities are also canceled.</p>

  <!-- end Weather Alert Closure Text   -->	

<!-- start SSCC Early Closure SEVERE Weather Alert 	
 <h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:0px;">SSCC Alert: Early Closure</h3>
 <p style="margin-top:0px;">Due to the threat of severe weather predicted for the West Alabama area, Shelton State Community College will close at <b>noon on Wednesday, May 6, 2026</b>.  All scheduled activities are also canceled. Additional information will be provided via the College’s website, SSCC Alert!, and social media as necessary.  Please monitor local media for weather updates.</p>

    <!-- end Early Closure SEVERE Weather Text   -->	

