<div class="partmid">
 				<p><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid hoverboxes"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc-hoverbox-wrapper  vc-hoverbox-shape--square vc-hoverbox-align--center vc-hoverbox-direction--default vc-hoverbox-width--100"  ontouchstart="">
  <div class="vc-hoverbox">
    <div class="vc-hoverbox-inner">
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-front" style="background-image: url(https://www.sheltonstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/s2.jpg);">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-front-inner">
            <h2 style="text-align:center">Student Engagement</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-back" style="background-color: ;">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-back-inner">
            
            <p>Your college experience at Shelton State will be what you make of it, so get involved, stay engaged, and GO BUCS!</p>

            <div class="vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-sm vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-flat vc_btn3-color-white" href="/student-life/student-organizations/" title="">Learn More</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc-hoverbox-wrapper  vc-hoverbox-shape--square vc-hoverbox-align--center vc-hoverbox-direction--default vc-hoverbox-width--100"  ontouchstart="">
  <div class="vc-hoverbox">
    <div class="vc-hoverbox-inner">
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-front" style="background-image: url(https://www.sheltonstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/s3.jpg);">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-front-inner">
            <h2 style="text-align:center">Living in Tuscaloosa</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-back" style="background-color: ;">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-back-inner">
            
            <p>Tuscaloosa offers an abundance of events and activities for all to enjoy.  From museums, sports, fine arts, and special events to shopping and southern dining, there is something for you!</p>

            <div class="vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-sm vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-flat vc_btn3-color-white" href="http://visittuscaloosa.com/" title="" target="_blank">Learn More</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc-hoverbox-wrapper  vc-hoverbox-shape--square vc-hoverbox-align--center vc-hoverbox-direction--default vc-hoverbox-width--100"  ontouchstart="">
  <div class="vc-hoverbox">
    <div class="vc-hoverbox-inner">
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-front" style="background-image: url(https://www.sheltonstate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/s4.jpg);">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-front-inner">
            <h2 style="text-align:center">Student Resources</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vc-hoverbox-block vc-hoverbox-back" style="background-color: ;">
        <div class="vc-hoverbox-block-inner vc-hoverbox-back-inner">
            
            <p>Learn more about on campus services such as the bookstore, dining and food, security, and testing and assessment.</p>

            <div class="vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-sm vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-flat vc_btn3-color-white" href="/student-life/student-resources/" title="">Learn More</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid bgtxt vc_custom_1511260716486 vc_row-has-fill"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="color: #113a60;text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading" >Find a Student Organization</h2><div  class="vc_wp_custommenu wpb_content_element"><div class="widget widget_nav_menu"><div class="menu-student-organization-container"><ul id="menu-student-organization" class="menu"><li id="menu-item-341" class="org menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children menu-item-341"><a href="#">Student Organization</a>
