	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1519253984441" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">Phi Theta Kappa International Honor Society recognizes and encourages scholarship among two-year college students.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_btn3-container  btnmedium nobg vc_btn3-center" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-modern vc_btn3-color-grey" href="/student-life/student-engagement/student-organizations/phi-theta-kappa/" title="">Go</a></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h3 style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading" ><a href="https://www.sheltonstate.edu/student-life/student-engagement/student-organizations/campus-ministries/" target="_blank">Campus Ministries</a></h3>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1519253992734" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">Shelton State offers opportunities for student organizations that represent major faiths and denominations to provide ministry to the College community.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_btn3-container  btnmedium nobg vc_btn3-center" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-modern vc_btn3-color-grey" href="/student-life/student-engagement/student-organizations/campus-ministries/" title="">Go</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid twodivs divfirst"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h3 style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_custom_1519253800933" >Collegiate 100</h3>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1519253974915" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">Collegiate 100 provides an avenue for 100 Black Men chapters to continue their one-on-one and group mentoring to students as they matriculate from high school to college.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_btn3-container  btnmedium nobg vc_btn3-center vc_custom_1524494344512" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-modern vc_btn3-color-grey" href="/student-life/student-engagement/student-organizations/collegiate-100/" title="">Go</a></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h3 style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading" >Shelton State Alumni Association</h3>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1519254003171" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">The Shelton State Alumni Association offers the opportunity to develop stronger relationships between friends and former students, network with others who have attended Shelton State Community College, and support and promote the goals, activities, and interests of the College.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_btn3-container  btnmedium nobg vc_btn3-center" ><a class="vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-square vc_btn3-style-modern vc_btn3-color-grey" href="/student-life/student-engagement/student-organizations/alumni-association/" title="">Go</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid bgtxt newbgtxt vc_custom_1511425140751 vc_row-has-fill"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading" ><a href="http://athletics.sheltonstate.edu/landing/index" target="_blank" class="blc-broken-link" data-blc-broken="1">Athletics</a></h2>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ul>
<li style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://athletics.sheltonstate.edu/sports/bsb/index" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="blc-broken-link" data-blc-broken="1">Baseball</a></li>
