<li style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://athletics.sheltonstate.edu/sports/sball/index" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="blc-broken-link" data-blc-broken="1">Softball</a></li>
<li style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://athletics.sheltonstate.edu/sports/wbkb/index" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="blc-broken-link" data-blc-broken="1">Women&#8217;s Basketball</a></li>
